# ── MARK LIII — what never belongs in the repository ──────────────────────────
# Everything listed here is created by the app on first run. A fresh clone with
# none of it present boots straight to the setup screen, which is the intended
# first experience — so nothing here needs to be committed, and some of it must
# never be.

# ── Secrets. Committing any of these publishes them. ──────────────────────────
# git does NOT support trailing comments on a pattern line: everything after the
# pattern, including the '#', is treated as part of the filename to match. Each
# note therefore has to live on its own line above its pattern.

# your Gemini API key, plus per-plugin credentials
config/api_keys.json
# Spotify OAuth access/refresh token
config/spotify_token.json
# personal application and URL aliases
config/shortcuts.json
# the local index of every application installed on this machine
config/app_index.json
# which applications you pin and open most often
config/app_usage.json
# extracted application icons for the launcher panel
config/app_icons/
# private-store backups, locks, quarantine, and temp files
config/*.json.*
# hidden private-store sidecars
config/.*.json.*
# the dashboard's TLS private key and certificate
config/certs/
# a LINKED WhatsApp session — committing it hands somebody your WhatsApp
# account, not just a key
config/whatsapp_web/
# Google OAuth tokens (Gmail / Calendar plugins)
**/token*.json
# Google OAuth client secrets
**/client_secret*.json
*credentials*.json
.env
.env.*

# ── Personal data the assistant accumulates about you ─────────────────────────
memory/long_term.json
# explicitly saved private conversation snapshots
memory/sessions.json
# private-store backups, locks, quarantine, and temp files
memory/*.json.*
# hidden private-store sidecars
memory/.*.json.*
# saved desktop window arrangements
memory/layouts.json
memory/*.db

# ── Python build noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# ── Virtual environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Editors and operating systems ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Runtime output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
downloads/
screenshots/
test-results/
*.overall-report.json
